                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mysterious Realms is a small sized retro RPG game, that although not an in depth game, does come through with some fun dungeon crawling.  The combat system is certainly a new system, that in it's own way makes the game fun and makes combat more than just hitting an attack button.\n\nNot only do you collect weapons, armor, potions, food etc, you also build up a deck of gem cards, that are used to directly set up your attacks. There are four different colors of gem cards as well as a wild gem card which you can pick the color of when using it to attack. When you use the colored gem cards in the correct order you enable your special abilities to be used. So if you keep track of what you are doing a big strike from your specials can be used each turn if you have the right cards.\n\nThe whole game is retro in graphics and sounds so if you love retro gaming, I highly recommend this game. It's definitely got enough fun in it for the price.",
